    "source":"Septemics: Scale of Attack" },
  { "id":"sn38", "word":"mania",         "pos":"noun",
    "definition":"Intense, uncontrollable excitement or obsession; in psychiatry, a phase of elation and hyperactivity.",
    "example":"The NFT mania of 2021 followed the classic boom structure — new technology, speculative pile-on, collapse.",
    "source":"Septemics: Scale of Stopping" },
  { "id":"sn39", "word":"paradox",       "pos":"noun",
    "definition":"A statement that seems contradictory or absurd yet may express a deeper truth.",
